{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_336e370e098293fec031ee9a7802e85ce1de6dcc93554657bd52e44f08543b3e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_226d071121a6577a46e2d07c735119d9e845da8929d8dcd4eb31315eebb42365","slc_39b1ab495faf9c0690af6033f3d95bedd33d5b3943f597dc990b967c834a8fba","slc_a496d3af6ff8beafacdaded68036ffa855f516a17a4de6bdf33eff3deffaaa4f"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"Remote desktop on macOS requires the user to grant Screen Recording and Accessibility permissions to Terminal or the 9Remote desktop app, and restart 9Remote afterward.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_558a78834dca145b97491084aa8db3be1da19771fc5133b7d8686374771e1c00","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_222f30b0cc6246d53739ee75791335d76f732bdf516eff6576e4bf3fdab9b232","slc_9ddae87a9be23bd12b7c96ac8d51d70cce9ff58c2eb9c8c8afe92313140cd82f"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"Documented features include a WebSocket PTY terminal, WebRTC-based remote desktop streaming, file explorer, code editor, git integration, and a proxy exposing local dev-server ports through the tunnel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56c66faea893302ee940f6cb7d590b0adc895b98b07dfb19a8110ed79d22d87b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2365398abeecbd95b082c55e19b3edb4c35a027d09dff1de489e334e9e3184ed"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"Documented stack: Node.js 20+, node-pty for PTY sessions, node-datachannel (WebRTC) plus robotjs for desktop control, Socket.IO for real-time, Preact agent UI, Next.js 16 web client, Tauri 2 desktop app, Expo mobile app, and Cloudflare Workers edge API.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5b5de097917769c1521417c9a0d3094f73efd264b951a8d5de180d32d8c18047","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12eb2f0bedc1ecfa8d52720bd696a49a4cbc508f68b59d967ebdfc2071bec1b4"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"Remote desktop uses adaptive framerate (60ms active, 400ms idle) with tile-based diff rendering so only changed screen regions are sent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9686ba383edf3920446c4276a7ff172a4d8712b017d432f304d7ac857b7acba4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_150b35b7bd67ee642c8d9bd9bf3c43fcb09aa56bb64426973f1bb75ded2177ab","slc_a598ea001019c46714eee6c1dfe42e6e3f0d9cc36c045785f5139aa1f1dd4463","slc_ee26acaa9c3fbe828094e3951c655064421f89e7d8b2d4611dfdfc6b566d458a"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"The tool targets developers who want to reach their dev machine's terminal, desktop, and files from a phone or browser, and is stated to work with terminal-based AI coding tools like Claude Code and Codex CLI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9e6241f01445377f59b13aec5a3c21664d5b44718f1a824191afae7ec43a76ea","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"decolua/9remote@2f5d212b1d04 snapshot ec56ca565012a576","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c91336a7251b2ce719c9b3401affbda19f48756288b8ae8efc5b2c86fb727ead","slc_f230ef94b96f3e6f30963ebcc04c3d198a2c2361cda658631fd0c1a4ec49d57e"],"source_ids":["src_47e75b4cf23a5b1e9e2c1c29505ea0d3"],"text":"Connectivity uses a Cloudflare Quick Tunnel with outbound-only connections, so no ports need to be opened and it works behind NAT, firewalls, and hotspots.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cdc101ea832c4450ac5e9a18a8577498"}
